<section
  class="workflow-guide"
  aria-labelledby="workflow-guide-title"
  aria-label="How YT Insights works"
>
  <div class="workflow-guide-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The local-first workflow</p>
      <h2 id="workflow-guide-title">From YouTube to usable evidence</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      Start with the corpus you already own. Add new videos only when the current evidence is
      incomplete or stale.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="workflow-steps">
    <li>
      <span class="workflow-step-number">01</span>
      <p class="workflow-step-label">Collect</p>
      <h3>Feed the corpus</h3>
      <p>Preview a channel, playlist, or video before approving the exact items to acquire.</p>
      <a href="/sources/">Add a source</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="workflow-step-number">02</span>
      <p class="workflow-step-label">Search</p>
      <h3>Reuse what you have</h3>
      <p>Find timestamped transcript passages and open the original moment on YouTube.</p>
      <a href="/search/">Search the corpus</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="workflow-step-number">03</span>
      <p class="workflow-step-label">Assess</p>
      <h3>Open a research session</h3>
      <p>Measure coverage and freshness for a topic before contacting YouTube again.</p>
      <a href="/research/new/">Start research</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="workflow-step-number">04</span>
      <p class="workflow-step-label">Decide</p>
      <h3>Grow deliberately</h3>
      <p>Confirm sufficiency or approve one to five exact discovery candidates.</p>
      <a href="/research/new/">Review the decision flow</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="workflow-step-number">05</span>
      <p class="workflow-step-label">Use</p>
      <h3>Publish a dossier</h3>
      <p>Open deterministic evidence exports, or query the corpus from an LLM through MCP.</p>
      <a href="/exports/">Open exports</a>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="workflow-principle">
    <span>LOCAL FIRST</span>
    <p>No LLM is required to search, index, or export your transcript evidence.</p>
  </div>
</section>
